### 1. Get all dishes (8 seeded dishes)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes

### 2. Get dishes filtered by restaurantId=1
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes?restaurantId=1


### 3. Get single dish by id (and test 404 with /999)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes/9



### 4. Create a valid new dish
POST http://localhost:3000/api/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Awaze Tibs",
  "priceSantim": 62000,
  "restaurantId": 1
}

### 5. Reject dish whose restaurantId does not exist (422 Unprocessable Entity)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost Dish",
  "priceSantim": 50000,
  "restaurantId": 3
}


### one restaurant
GET http://localhost:3000/api/restaurants?area=Bole
